Well, yeah!

00:34:35.410 --> 00:34:40.460
It's a huge story, if you think that this
is how the entirety of small business is

00:34:40.460 --> 00:34:44.650
gonna manage their business in a way that
allows them the free time with their

00:34:44.650 --> 00:34:48.750
family, the ability to leverage their
economics to,

00:34:48.750 --> 00:34:50.123
to grow their business, all these things,
